          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">At the end of your Command phase, if the bearer's unit is within range of an objective marker you control, that objective marker remains under your control, even if you have no models within range of it, until your opponent controls it at the start or end of any turn. (Default enhancement; may be replaced with Stealthy Hunter: The bearer has the Lone Operative and Stealth abilities, and its master-crafted bolt carbine has the [Anti-Infantry 4+], [Devastating Wounds] and [Precision] abilities.)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
